{
  "id": "car-alongside-search-6",
  "product": "alongside",
  "guide": "how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on",
  "situation": "searchedProblems[5].phrase",
  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "quote": {
        "text": "I left something half finished and lost where I was",
        "source": "searchedProblems[5].phrase"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "finished"
      ],
      "promise": {
        "text": "How to restart a project you gave up on",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/title"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "In short",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Coming back costs more than starting did, mostly the rebuilding of where you got to.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/dek#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "What to write down, and how to resume without re-reading everything.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/dek#1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to restart, in order",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "1",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Put out what you already have.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[0]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "The form, the emails, the receipt, whatever you did last time, all where you can see it.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[0]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't read it yet.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[0]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "already"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to restart, in order",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "2",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Write where you got to, in one line.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[1]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Where you stopped inside the task, not what the task is.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[1]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If you can't tell, look for the newest thing you produced: the last email sent, the last page filled in.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[1]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "Write"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to restart, in order",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "3",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Check whether it still needs doing.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[2]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Ask three questions: is anyone waiting on it, does it have a date that has passed or is coming, and would you be glad to have it done?",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[2]#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "whether"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to restart, in order",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "4",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Look for what was missing last time.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[3]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "A password, a document that never arrived, an answer someone else owed you.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[3]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If it's still missing, getting it is your real next step, and it's often a short call or email.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[3]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "missing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How to restart, in order",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "5",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Name the smallest piece and do only that.",
        "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[4]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Small enough that starting it isn't a decision: find the paperwork and put it on the desk, photograph one sticker, write the first line of the email.",
          "source": "guide:how-to-restart-a-project-you-gave-up-on/body[3].items[4]#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "smallest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "help",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How it helps",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "name": {
        "text": "ADHD Life Companion",
        "source": "title"
      },
      "line": {
        "text": "It remembers exactly where you got to, so picking it back up is not starting over.",
        "source": "searchedProblems[5].answer"
      },
